================================================================================================
WHERE V3's DEPTH COMES FROM — controlled vs uncontrolled evolution
================================================================================================
  One Trotter layer of the sensing evolution at a=kappa-1 (the longest),
  built identically except for .control(1). Heisenberg chain.

     N  T terms  uncontrolled  controlled   ratio  unctrl cx  ctrl cx  cx ratio
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     4        9           357         564     1.6        130      266       2.0
     6       15           621         972     1.6        226      458       2.0
     8       21           885        1380     1.6        322      650       2.0
    10       27          1149        1788     1.6        418      842       2.0
    12       33          1413        2196     1.6        514     1034       2.0

  growth exponents   depth: uncontrolled N^1.25, controlled N^1.24
                     cx   : uncontrolled N^1.25, controlled N^1.23

  If the uncontrolled depth exponent is ~0 and the controlled one ~1, the
  Theta(N) depth is the SHARED ANCILLA serialising an operation that is
  intrinsically parallel, and ancilla fan-out removes it for all N.
  If both are ~1, the depth is the physics and no fan-out helps.

  NOTE the cx columns. Fan-out changes SCHEDULING, not gate count, so
  whatever the cx exponent is, it is unchanged by the fix - and cx is what
  fidelity is charged on. A depth fix does not revive V3 on noisy hardware.
